<title>SINGAPORE: Electronic Res placement shares taken up.</title>
<headline>Electronic Res placement shares taken up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Resources Ltd said on Friday Fraser Securities Pte Ltd had agreed to subscribe for its placement of 13.37 million new ordinary shares of Singapore $0.10 each at S$1.55 per share.</p>
<p>It added the net proceeds from the placement were estimated at S$20.6 million and would be used for working capital.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
